 🤝 Contributing to PWC – Prigid World Cloud

Hi there! 👋  
First of all, **thank you** for showing interest in helping build the future of open, intelligent, and decentralized cloud infrastructure.

This project is in its **early stages**, and we welcome **everyone** — developers, designers, writers, testers, dreamers. Your contributions, no matter how big or small, are valuable.

---

 🧭 What is PWC?

PWC (Prigid World Cloud) is an open-source initiative to build a **next-generation cloud platform** that is:

- Modular and composable
- AI-native
- Privacy-respecting
- Globally inclusive
- Built by and for the open-source community

We’re reimagining cloud computing from the ground up — and we want YOU to help shape it.

